==Battleground==
*8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*6 [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Li'l Zyclone]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Cadaver Bear]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Dread Bore]]s spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

